Histologia — Tatiana Montanari (@med-source-histology: 0, is #book, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_19MSRBKWFADMAH4P4TT7HG81KS
Tatiana Montanari. Histologia: texto, atlas e roteiro de aulas práticas. 3rd edition, Porto Alegre, 2016. Português brasileiro.

[Authorized source](https://professor.ufrgs.br/tatianamontanari/files/livrodehisto2016.pdf).

An author-hosted UFRGS text and atlas for studying cells and epithelial, connective, cartilage, bone, muscle, and nervous tissues. Compare each relevant chapter with the guide rather than beginning with the entire organ histology catalogue. [UFRGS repository edition](https://lume.ufrgs.br/bitstream/handle/10183/157069/001020057.pdf).

**Access and reuse:** Institutional and author-hosted free reading. No local copy is supplied, and no general adaptation licence is asserted here. Automated retrieval of the author PDF was unavailable during assembly; the institutional catalogue and indexed edition identify the work. Inspect its notices before retaining or reusing text or images.

